{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrens Of Random is a first-person horror game where you must escape 20 mazes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Spawns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a chance that you spawn in a random maze instead of the intended one (like Maze 7 instead of Maze 10). Those don't count either as a maze you survived, which means you may survive more than 20 times, but must complete all 20 mazes in order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>Normal</strong> mode, <strong>Hardcore</strong> mode, and <strong>Speedrunner</strong> mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Normal mode, you have 3 lives and can ping the exit every 5 minutes. This is so you can familiarize yourself with the mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hardcore mode, you have 1 life and there's a higher chance of random spawns. You also can't ping either, so you better know the mazes by now if you play in Hardcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedrunner mode, you have 1 life and no random spawns. Finish the game as fast as you can, otherwise you'll lose to someone who knows where you are 24/7</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098870?t=1760905443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098870?t=1760905443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/070d31ab29fcaccdacbc7e12bc6b1ad7e3555868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760905443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/070d31ab29fcaccdacbc7e12bc6b1ad7e3555868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760905443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrens Of Random is a first-person horror game where you must escape 20 mazes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Spawns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a chance that you spawn in a random maze instead of the intended one (like Maze 7 instead of Maze 10). Those don't count either as a maze you survived, which means you may survive more than 20 times, but must complete all 20 mazes in order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>Normal</strong> mode, <strong>Hardcore</strong> mode, and <strong>Speedrunner</strong> mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Normal mode, you have 3 lives and can ping the exit every 5 minutes. This is so you can familiarize yourself with the mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hardcore mode, you have 1 life and there's a higher chance of random spawns. You also can't ping either, so you better know the mazes by now if you play in Hardcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedrunner mode, you have 1 life and no random spawns. Finish the game as fast as you can, otherwise you'll lose to someone who knows where you are 24/7</p></li></ul>","developers":["Saudade Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098870/6c9a3708f91b407e797e5cc4f4c6261cc1518892/header.jpg?t=1760905443"